  "settingsFaqBodyScanQuestion": "How is my body scan calculated?",
  "settingsFaqBodyScanAnswer": "Log your weight and body-fat % from \"Log body weight\" on the dashboard checklist. We combine the weight trend with the body-fat trend so we can tell muscle gain from fat gain, instead of just watching the scale number move.",
  "settingsFaqSyncWearableQuestion": "How do I sync a wearable device?",
