  "settingsFaqTrackWorkoutAnswer": "Open the Plan tab and tap the workout card — it opens a set-by-set checklist. Tap each set as you finish it; progress saves automatically, even if you close the app mid-workout.",
  "settingsFaqExportDataQuestion": "Can I export my progress data?",
  "settingsFaqExportDataAnswer": "Not yet — that's on the roadmap. Your profile, weight and body measurements sync to your account when you're signed in and a server is reachable; progress photos, meals, and workouts stay on this device only.",
